cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite the accompanying article and this repository."
title: "Stochastic energy-harvesting precision bound: simulation and analysis code"
abstract: >-
  Code and computed results accompanying a study of a parameter-free precision
  (kinetic) bound on the fluctuations of work harvested from broadband random
  vibration, and an associated nonlinear fluctuation-control design law, verified
  numerically, on a real NDBC buoy spectrum, against an independent bistable model,
  and on measured records of a commercial piezoelectric harvester.
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: "Yang"
    given-names: "Qinyou"
version: "1.0.0"
date-released: "2026-10-27"
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/QinyouYang/harvester-precision-bound"
url: "https://github.com/QinyouYang/harvester-precision-bound"
keywords:
  - stochastic thermodynamics
  - energy harvesting
  - work fluctuations
  - bistable oscillator
  - precision bound
